#: of pyvista_js.readers.OBJReader:3
msgid ""
"Reads an OBJ ASCII file and produces a :class:`Mesh` that delegates "
"parsing to vtk.js's ``vtkOBJReader`` at render time. Python extracts only"
" the vertex coordinates so that camera framing and bounding-sphere "
"queries work before rendering."
msgstr ""

